## 4. Spacing

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `xs` | 4px | Micro gaps, icon inner spacing |
| `sm` | 8px | Tight element gaps, chip padding |
| `md` | 12px | Standard inter-element gaps |
| `lg` | 16px | Card padding, section margins |
| `xl` | 20px | Content block spacing |
| `xxl` | 24px | Page horizontal padding |
| `xxxl` | 32px | Major section separation |

---

## 5. Border Radii

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `sm` | 12px | Buttons, transaction toggles, check circles |
| `md` | 18px | Icon boxes |
| `lg` | 24px | Cards, group containers |
| `pill` | 999px | Search bars, filter chips |

