## 6. Component Patterns

### 6.1 Settings Option Card (Language, Appearance)

```
┌───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ┌──────┐                                 │
│  │ icon │  Title (Manrope 800)      ○     │
│  │ 48×48│  Description (caption)          │
│  └──────┘                                 │
└───────────────────────────────────────────┘

Default:    border: 1px divider, bg: transparent
Selected:   border: 2px textPrimary, bg: transparent
Icon box:   border: 1px divider, bg: transparent
Check:      border: 1px divider → fill: textPrimary when selected
```

### 6.2 Menu Group Card (Profile)

```
SECTION LABEL (10px, Manrope 800, uppercase, letter-spacing 2)

┌───────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  (○) icon   Label (Manrope 800)     ›     │
│  ─────────────────────────────────────    │
│  (○) icon   Label                    ›     │
│             description (caption)         │
└───────────────────────────────────────────┘

Card:       border: 1px divider, bg: transparent, radius: 24
Icon box:   36×36, border: 1px divider, bg: transparent, radius: 18
Divider:    1px divider, marginHorizontal: 16
```

### 6.3 Profile Hero (Horizontal Layout)

```
┌──────┐
│  AS  │  Display Name (Manrope 800, 20px)
│64×64 │  Left-aligned (LTR) / Right-aligned (RTL)
└──────┘

Avatar:     64×64, radius: 32, border: 1px divider, bg: transparent
Hero row:   flexDirection: isRTL ? "row-reverse" : "row"
Name:       textAlign: isRTL ? "right" : "left"
```

### 6.4 Property Card

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  [image carousel]                  ♡    │  ← Heart in top-right
│                                         │
│  Title (left-aligned)                   │
│  Location (caption)                     │
│                                         │
│  Price (left-aligned)    3bed · 2bath   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘

Price + specs:  flexDirection row, justifyContent: flex-start
Heart icon:     positioned absolute top-right
No badges:      "Top Match" / status labels removed
```

### 6.5 Floating Header

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ← back   [ 🔍 search ... ]   🗺  ⚙    │
│  [ All ] [ For sale ] [ Villas ] ...     │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘

Background:  colors.background + E6 opacity (90%)
Border:      1px bottom divider
Buttons:     40×40, radius: 20, bg: surface, border: 1px divider
Search:      flex: 1, radius: pill, bg: surface, border: 1px divider
```

---

## 7. Dark Mode / Light Mode

### 7.1 Resolution

The appearance mode is stored in Zustand (`preferenceSlice`) as one of three values:

| Mode | Behavior |
|---|---|
| `"system"` | Follows `useColorScheme()` from React Native |
| `"light"` | Forces light palette |
| `"dark"` | Forces dark palette |

Resolution logic (in `appearance.ts`):
```ts
if (mode === "light" || mode === "dark") return mode;
return systemColorScheme === "light" ? "light" : "dark";
```

### 7.2 How Colors Expand

Both modes share **identical structure** — only values change:

| Property | Light | Dark |
|---|---|---|
| Canvas ground | `#FFFFFF` | `#000000` |
| Structural lines | `rgba(0,0,0,0.08)` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)` |
| Primary text | `#000000` | `#FFFFFF` |
| Secondary text | `#52525B` | `#A3A3A3` |
| Muted text | `#A1A1AA` | `#737373` |
| Accent | `#EC2D35` | `#EC2D35` (invariant) |

The accent red **never changes** between modes. It is the only color constant.

### 7.3 Dark Mode Rules

1. **True black background** (`#000000`) — not dark gray. This maximizes contrast on OLED displays.
2. **Surface layers** (`#121212`, `#1A1A1A`) exist in tokens but are **not used** for card backgrounds in Pure Canvas. They remain for legacy components only.
3. **Dividers** use 8% white opacity — barely visible, providing structure without visual weight.
4. **StatusBar** automatically switches: `style="light"` on dark, `style="dark"` on light.
5. **System background color** is set via `expo-system-ui` to match `colors.background` for native splash/transition consistency.

---

## 8. Animation & Motion

### 8.1 Entry Animations

| Pattern | API | Parameters |
|---|---|---|
| List items | `FadeInDown` | `delay(index * 100).duration(400)` |
| Hero sections | `FadeInUp.springify()` | Spring defaults |
| Sections | `FadeIn.duration(300)` | Simple opacity |

### 8.2 Scroll-Linked Motion

The floating header uses `useScrollPositionMotion` with:
- **Threshold**: 44px scroll before background appears
- **Background**: `colors.background` at `E6` (90%) opacity
- **Edge fade**: `EdgeFade` component with gradient opacity ramp

---

## 9. RTL / Internationalization Rules

| Element | LTR | RTL |
|---|---|---|
| `flexDirection` | `"row"` | `"row-reverse"` |
| `textAlign` | `"left"` | `"right"` |
| `alignItems` | `"flex-start"` | `"flex-end"` |
| Back arrow | Normal | `mirrorIcon(isRTL)` flips horizontally |
| Chevron right | Normal | `mirrorIcon(isRTL)` flips horizontally |
| Filter scroll | `flexDirection: "row"` | `flexDirection: "row-reverse"` |
| Hero name | `textAlign: "left"` | `textAlign: "right"` |

Every layout-directional style is computed inside `createStyles(colors, isRTL)` using the ternary pattern.

---

## 10. Anti-Patterns (What NOT to Do)

> [!CAUTION]
> These patterns are explicitly banned in Pure Canvas.

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do Instead |
|---|---|
| `backgroundColor: colors.surface` on cards | `backgroundColor: "transparent"` |
| `backgroundColor: colors.surfaceRaised` on icon boxes | `backgroundColor: "transparent"` + `borderWidth: 1` |
| `shadowColor`, `shadowOpacity`, `elevation` | Remove entirely |
| `borderColor: colors.accent` for selection | `borderColor: colors.textPrimary` |
| `backgroundColor: colors.accent` for checkmarks | `backgroundColor: colors.textPrimary` |
| `backgroundColor: \`${colors.accent}14\`` tint fills | No fill — border only |
| Centered profile hero (avatar + name stacked) | Horizontal row with RTL awareness |
| `fontWeight: "700"` without fontFamily | `fontFamily: "Manrope_800ExtraBold"` |
| Banner images / hero cards in settings | Remove — Pure Canvas uses text hierarchy |

